# Reactions to a big day of sales (T-124): the shopkeepers notice when the shipping bin did very well. Fired when a day's earnings reach 300 gold. Compiled to zz_fs_sale_reactions.json.

reaction sale.tilda
on random:big_sale
npcs tilda
ttl 3
if hearts:tilda>=2
plays sale.tilda.d
say sale.tilda.d tilda: A very full bin yesterday, dear! The seed shelf is jealous. I've put a little extra in your next order.

reaction sale.wren
on random:big_sale
npcs wren
ttl 3
if hearts:wren>=2
plays sale.wren.d
say sale.wren.d wren: I hear the bin did very well, my darling. The whole valley's talking. Sit. First cup's on the house, second's on the shipping.

reaction sale.felix
on random:big_sale
npcs felix
ttl 3
if hearts:felix>=2
plays sale.felix.d
say sale.felix.d felix: Heard you had a big haul. Hm. Bigger than my biggest fish. Almost. It was this big.

reaction sale.marcus
on random:big_sale
npcs marcus
ttl 3
if hearts:marcus>=2
plays sale.marcus.d
say sale.marcus.d marcus: Good sale. A farm that pays can build. Think about the barn.
